WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:13.430
Prepare consistent Store copies from before the incident and the investigation point.
Each Store stays in its own tab.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:25.370
Compare snapshots first. The increase to 161 Advisory observations narrows the changed area,
but does not prove the cause.

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:37.470
Use Journal retention to locate the files and offsets behind the change.
Offset order is authoritative only within the same journal.

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:53.530
Trace one exact JMSMessageID across supported ADD, ACK/remove,
transaction, and raw observations.

00:00:54.230 --> 00:01:04.670
Send only the selected observation to an Incident Case,
then pin it with its Store signature and provenance.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:17.330
Review every export and redaction option.
The evidence bundle excludes the original Store and does not determine root cause.
